# A grey test level for R3's frame-time check: ten screens wide (6400 px) and
# five floors tall (96 px apart), with ladders, gaps, lava, spikes, scorpions,
# bats, braziers and chests. Not in any act; `scenes/rooms/test_tall.tscn`
# dresses it as Act 1 so the light field and backdrop are measured too.
size 16
